WEBVTT

00:05.970 --> 00:07.388
<i>Good morning!</i>

00:07.472 --> 00:08.598
<i>Rise and shine!</i>

00:08.890 --> 00:10.308
<i>This is Morioh Radio.</i>

00:10.391 --> 00:14.478
<i>Kai Harada, here,
keeping you company this A.M</i>

00:14.729 --> 00:16.272
<i>And what a morning it is!</i>

00:16.689 --> 00:17.856
<i>Today's gonna be a beauty,</i>

00:17.941 --> 00:19.442
<i>and I have just what
the doctor ordered</i>

00:19.817 --> 00:22.110
<i>All you have to do is
sit back and enjoy</i>

01:07.865 --> 01:09.700
Oh, there it is.

01:09.867 --> 01:12.786
The reception usually clears up
once you're past the tower.

01:12.954 --> 01:16.123
First time in Morioh, sir?

01:16.457 --> 01:17.207
Yeah.

01:17.333 --> 01:18.667
Anything I should know?

01:18.918 --> 01:21.795
Morioh? Hmm…

01:22.255 --> 01:22.797
Ah!

01:22.880 --> 01:25.424
The miso-marinated beef
tongue is good.

01:25.633 --> 01:28.302
Anything unusual?
Strange incidents?

01:28.761 --> 01:31.054
Sorry, young man…

01:31.139 --> 01:33.641
Afraid I can't help you there.

01:33.850 --> 01:36.727
Um, would you kindly
remind me of our destination?

01:37.895 --> 01:39.605
Yes, in front of the station.

01:39.814 --> 01:41.440
No problem.

01:45.445 --> 01:46.696
Good grief…

01:47.322 --> 01:50.074
This'd better not be what I think it is.

01:53.745 --> 01:57.039
JOJO'S BIZARRE ADVENTURE
DIAMOND IS UNBREAKABLE

01:59.000 --> 02:01.669
<i>I remember it was April, 1999.</i>

02:01.002 --> 02:05.502
EPISODE 1
JOTARO KUJO! MEETS JOSUKE HIGASHIKATA

02:02.170 --> 02:03.629
<i>It was my first day of high school,</i>

02:03.713 --> 02:06.111
<i>And I was about to make
two very bizarre friends.</i>

02:07.800 --> 02:09.510
<i>So today I become a high schooler.</i>

02:09.594 --> 02:11.345
<i>Wonder what the other kids'll be like…</i>

02:12.138 --> 02:14.181
<i>If you care to know,
my name's Koichi Hirose.</i>

02:14.349 --> 02:16.893
<i>Though, I guess,
it's not that big a deal.</i>

02:17.352 --> 02:20.396
<i>Anyway, I was walking to class,
nervous as can be, and then…</i>

02:29.113 --> 02:30.405
Oh! Wha—?

02:30.531 --> 02:32.616
I could've sworn I just…

02:32.784 --> 02:34.243
All my stuff…

02:34.452 --> 02:36.412
Sorry, I wasn't paying attention.

02:36.704 --> 02:38.122
<i>He's giant!</i>

02:38.665 --> 02:40.583
<i>He must be
over 190 centimeters tall!</i>

02:41.042 --> 02:42.418
Maybe you can help me.

02:42.669 --> 02:45.797
Do you know of a family
by the name of Higashikata?

02:46.047 --> 02:48.174
Higashikata? Well…

02:48.424 --> 02:50.300
Then how bout this address?

02:50.551 --> 02:52.135
Jozenji 1-6.

02:52.512 --> 02:54.430
<i>Jotaro Kujo…</i>

02:54.806 --> 02:58.309
You can get to Jozenji
by taking the #3 bus.

02:58.393 --> 03:00.728
It won't be long before
one comes around.

03:00.937 --> 03:01.979
Thanks.

03:03.606 --> 03:06.483
<i>I first met him, Jotaro Kujo.</i>

03:06.901 --> 03:11.401
<i>Turns out he's twenty eight
and a marine explorer.</i>

03:12.615 --> 03:15.117
<i>Academics apparently know him
for his bio research.</i>

03:16.035 --> 03:19.371
<i>There's something fierce
but also intellectual about him…</i>

03:19.872 --> 03:20.789
<i>Wow..</i>

03:20.915 --> 03:23.792
Hey! You another freshman?

03:24.252 --> 03:25.503
What, no introduction?

03:25.712 --> 03:26.713
S-Sir!

03:26.921 --> 03:28.797
I'm freshman Koichi Hirose.

03:29.048 --> 03:31.050
Good day, sir!

03:31.384 --> 03:33.094
All right. That's more like it.

03:34.762 --> 03:36.847
Y-Yikes!

03:37.473 --> 03:38.682
Don't worry.

03:38.933 --> 03:41.226
Those guys'll get on a different bus.

03:41.394 --> 03:43.270
The hell you doing, dick face?!

03:43.354 --> 03:44.521
Who do you think you are?

03:46.190 --> 03:47.566
What am I doing? Well…

03:47.775 --> 03:51.653
Seems this turtle here just
woke up from his hibernation.

03:52.113 --> 03:53.739
Turtles give me the willies.

03:54.031 --> 03:55.824
I can barely touch 'em.

03:56.117 --> 03:58.702
So I thought I might conquer
my fears, kinda…

03:58.786 --> 04:00.537
I don't give a shit!

04:00.621 --> 04:02.122
Get up, dumb-ass!

04:12.467 --> 04:13.593
Well, well…

04:13.676 --> 04:16.345
Pretty tall for a pathetic freshman.

04:16.429 --> 04:19.682
But… if you wanna dress
like a pompous prick…

04:19.766 --> 04:22.685
you gotta pay your respects
to us first!

04:22.894 --> 04:25.730
Um, reptiles kinda
give me the heebie-jeebies.

04:25.813 --> 04:27.689
They're so creepy…

04:28.399 --> 04:30.317
What are you smirking at?

04:33.946 --> 04:34.821
Forgive me.

04:35.323 --> 04:36.699
I didn't know, sir.

04:36.866 --> 04:38.450
I've put a lot of guys in the ho spit a I

04:38.659 --> 04:42.245
whose last words were exactly that.

04:42.497 --> 04:44.165
You wanna end up

04:44.832 --> 04:47.417
like this turtle?! Huh?!

04:49.212 --> 04:50.630
He's sick…

04:50.797 --> 04:53.049
I'll have mercy on you this time.

04:53.174 --> 04:55.593
You can leave your jacket
and pants here with us.

04:55.676 --> 04:56.802
And your cash, too!

04:56.969 --> 04:58.971
Right, I'm very sorry, sir.

04:59.263 --> 05:03.350
Dress like that,
and you're asking for trouble.

05:03.518 --> 05:04.602
What pisses me off…

05:04.852 --> 05:07.729
is how he can just sit back and watch
them pulverize that turtle.

05:07.855 --> 05:08.981
Hey, pussy!

05:09.232 --> 05:10.775
Why don't you tell us your name?

05:10.858 --> 05:11.608
Of course.

05:12.026 --> 05:13.152
Class 1 -B.

05:13.736 --> 05:15.904
Josuke Higashikata.

05:18.658 --> 05:19.408
What?

05:19.492 --> 05:21.118
Josuke Higashikata?

05:22.328 --> 05:24.246
"Jo" and "Jo," eh?

05:24.455 --> 05:25.205
Josuke, huh?

05:25.498 --> 05:28.250
"JoJo" is gonna be
your name from now on!

05:28.543 --> 05:30.836
Oh…
Thank you very much.

05:31.629 --> 05:33.922
So take off that jacket already!

05:34.048 --> 05:35.382
The freak in bus is here!

05:35.633 --> 05:36.884
Hurry it up,

05:37.134 --> 05:39.928
or I'll chop that fugly cowlick straight off!

05:40.221 --> 05:41.972
What's the matter? Hurry up!

05:42.223 --> 05:43.891
Excuse me, sir…

05:45.726 --> 05:49.271
What'd you just say
about my hair?

05:53.860 --> 05:55.528
<i>What? A Stand?!</i>

05:59.949 --> 06:02.159
My nose… My teeth!

06:02.827 --> 06:05.871
Talk shit about my hair,

06:06.080 --> 06:08.123
and feel pain
like you've never felt!

06:08.457 --> 06:11.251
So my hair looks like
a freak in toupee, huh?

06:11.460 --> 06:14.004
Huh?! No one said…

06:14.088 --> 06:15.881
I know what I heard, dammit!

06:16.090 --> 06:16.673
What the?

06:16.757 --> 06:18.925
That punk just went flying.

06:19.010 --> 06:20.261
<i>There's no doubt.</i>

06:20.553 --> 06:22.555
<i>I saw a Stand just now</i>

06:27.810 --> 06:30.229
Huh? That turtle's cuts are…

06:33.357 --> 06:34.358
What the hell?

06:34.692 --> 06:37.111
Your nose and teeth
are healing themselves!

06:37.528 --> 06:38.946
Hey, he's all better!

06:39.113 --> 06:41.657
But his face is all weird now!

06:42.116 --> 06:44.326
It's changed!

06:44.493 --> 06:44.993
Huh?

06:45.077 --> 06:48.080
No! What happened
to my face? Hey!

06:48.664 --> 06:50.082
Thanks to you,

06:50.166 --> 06:53.419
I had to go and touch something
I didn't really want to touch.

06:53.669 --> 06:56.963
How're you gonna
make it up to me now, huh?!

06:59.800 --> 07:03.887
Wait! My nose!
What happened to it? Huh?

07:04.388 --> 07:05.555
Good grief.

07:06.474 --> 07:07.516
This guy…

07:17.026 --> 07:19.028
Gah! Holy shit!

07:20.237 --> 07:22.280
Oh, that turtle again.

07:23.324 --> 07:24.533
<i>So I was right.</i>

07:24.992 --> 07:27.285
<i>The turtle's healed</i>

07:27.578 --> 07:29.371
Josuke Higashikata…

07:29.580 --> 07:31.748
Born: 1983

07:32.166 --> 07:33.709
Mother's name: Tomoko

07:33.876 --> 07:37.379
She was twenty-one,
attending university in Tokyo.

07:37.630 --> 07:39.965
You've called this town home
your entire life.

07:40.383 --> 07:43.594
Then, in 1987,
when you were four,

07:43.928 --> 07:45.721
you came down
with a mysterious fever.

07:46.013 --> 07:49.558
For fifty days,
you were at death's door.

07:50.601 --> 07:52.060
Your father's name is…

07:52.478 --> 07:53.228
<i>Good grief</i>

07:53.479 --> 07:55.189
<i>How'd I get stuck in
the middle of this?</i>

07:55.856 --> 07:59.150
Your father's name is
Joseph Joestar.

08:00.820 --> 08:02.738
He's seventy-eight.

08:02.947 --> 08:05.240
And founder of Joestar Realty.

08:05.574 --> 08:06.908
<i>The Joseph Joestar?</i>

08:07.201 --> 08:09.578
<i>He's that American real estate mogul.</i>

08:09.787 --> 08:11.413
Don't worry, he's fine.

08:11.539 --> 08:14.625
When I was looking into how
to divide his properties,

08:14.792 --> 08:18.879
I learned he had a son,
that would be you, living in Japan.

08:19.213 --> 08:21.632
Even the old man had no idea.

08:22.049 --> 08:23.258
Piece of shit…

08:23.592 --> 08:26.928
Bastard said his wife
was his one and only.

08:27.221 --> 08:30.432
Then I find you, the son he fathered
when he had his affair

08:31.434 --> 08:33.060
at the ripe old age of sixty-two.

08:33.185 --> 08:35.604
Sorry, guess
I shouldn't have said that.

08:36.022 --> 08:37.815
I'm Jotaro Kujo.

08:38.065 --> 08:42.027
I guess, technically,
I'm your nephew.

08:42.278 --> 08:43.570
Weird, huh?

08:43.654 --> 08:46.782
Nephew?
Um, it's a pleasure.

08:48.826 --> 08:50.369
Come on, let's talk.

08:54.165 --> 08:58.665
So, eventually, a third of the
old man's inheritance will go to you.

09:00.254 --> 09:02.589
That's the message
I've come to pass on.

09:02.798 --> 09:04.508
The old man's affair
has turned

09:04.592 --> 09:06.802
the Joestar family
upside down.

09:07.261 --> 09:09.429
Upside down?

09:09.513 --> 09:13.683
Yeah… My grandma, Suzie Q,
is the angriest she's ever been

09:13.976 --> 09:15.769
in their 61 years of marriage.

09:17.104 --> 09:19.523
Forgive me!
This is all my fault!

09:19.857 --> 09:21.692
Hey. Wait a second.

09:22.026 --> 09:24.028
Why are you apologizing?

09:24.612 --> 09:28.991
Well, I'd hate to be the cause
of the family falling apart.

09:29.325 --> 09:32.995
My mother always said
she was deeply in love.

09:33.496 --> 09:35.080
That's enough for me.

09:35.498 --> 09:38.751
Could you tell, uh, my dad, or…
Mr. Joestar,

09:38.834 --> 09:41.253
he doesn't have to
concern himself with us?

09:41.337 --> 09:42.254
Thank you.

09:42.463 --> 09:43.964
<i>What's with this kid?</i>

09:44.632 --> 09:47.217
<i>I came here ready to be decked
on behalf of the old man,</i>

09:47.426 --> 09:50.429
<i>and instead he's apologizing?</i>

09:50.846 --> 09:51.847
Hey, it's Josuke!

09:51.931 --> 09:52.932
So it is!

09:53.057 --> 09:54.016
Josuke!

09:54.183 --> 09:55.642
– How are you?
– What a coincidence!

09:55.726 --> 09:56.518
Come with me to class?

09:56.936 --> 09:58.771
Your hair looks as handsome as ever.

09:58.938 --> 10:00.022
Looking good!

10:00.147 --> 10:02.190
You're different from the other guys.

10:02.733 --> 10:05.736
Um… We're actually in the middle of
an important chat…

10:05.820 --> 10:06.904
Ah, come on!

10:06.987 --> 10:08.822
If you don't hurry up,
you're gonna be late.

10:08.906 --> 10:10.449
You can talk later.

10:10.658 --> 10:11.659
Hey, Josuke.

10:11.951 --> 10:13.202
We're not done talking.

10:13.619 --> 10:14.828
Get 'em out of here.

10:14.954 --> 10:16.080
Who the hell is this guy?

10:16.163 --> 10:19.207
Hey, you can waste your time
talking about his hair later.

10:21.752 --> 10:23.837
He's done it now.

10:24.130 --> 10:25.381
Not his hair!

10:26.340 --> 10:28.091
You bastard…

10:28.384 --> 10:31.011
What'd you say
about my hair?!

10:31.303 --> 10:32.220
This isn't good.

10:32.388 --> 10:33.847
Don't blame me!

10:33.931 --> 10:37.434
Josuke can't stand it when
someone disses his hair.

10:37.768 --> 10:39.936
It's just what happened before!

10:40.146 --> 10:41.522
Hold it, Josuke.

10:41.814 --> 10:43.857
That wasn't meant to…

10:46.694 --> 10:48.237
<i>Dammit! Here it comes!</i>

10:52.741 --> 10:53.491
Josuke!

10:53.826 --> 10:54.576
He's bleeding!

10:54.910 --> 10:56.411
See it, Josuke?

10:57.037 --> 10:58.830
This is a Stand.

10:58.998 --> 11:01.500
A physical manifestation
of the soul.

11:01.667 --> 11:03.627
Joseph Joestar has one, too.

11:04.211 --> 11:07.505
Only a Stand user
can see another Stand.

11:07.882 --> 11:11.635
It pisses me off when someone
bad-mouths my pride and joy.

11:12.136 --> 11:14.096
It really pisses me off!

11:17.600 --> 11:19.393
So this is Josuke's Stand!

11:24.523 --> 11:26.274
His power…

11:26.859 --> 11:30.571
Your chest's wide open!

11:31.280 --> 11:32.656
Bastard!

11:33.324 --> 11:34.408
What?!

11:36.744 --> 11:37.202
Huh?

11:37.286 --> 11:38.036
When did that-

11:38.245 --> 11:38.954
What's going on?

11:39.038 --> 11:40.831
Bastard, when did y–

11:41.832 --> 11:42.958
Josuke!

11:43.083 --> 11:44.793
– No!
–Josuke!

11:45.628 --> 11:46.503
Shut the hell up!

11:46.670 --> 11:48.630
That bitching irritates me to all hell!

11:48.756 --> 11:49.673
Get lost!

11:51.258 --> 11:52.759
Fine…

11:53.219 --> 11:54.511
Guess they know each other.

11:54.637 --> 11:55.888
He's kinda scary.

11:56.263 --> 11:58.139
And hot…

11:58.933 --> 11:59.808
<i>I don't understand..</i>

12:00.142 --> 12:02.978
<i>I don't understand any of it!</i>

12:03.812 --> 12:05.605
<i>This is all too weird!</i>

12:06.774 --> 12:07.900
<i>It's been a while…</i>

12:08.275 --> 12:10.068
<i>Ten years, actually</i>

12:11.153 --> 12:13.655
<i>I managed to stop time
for half a second only</i>

12:13.948 --> 12:16.700
<i>If I hadn't stopped time…
I doubt we would've been killed,</i>

12:16.784 --> 12:18.869
<i>but one of us
would've been injured bad</i>

12:19.286 --> 12:20.829
Here, Josuke.

12:21.497 --> 12:23.749
Ah, uh… No. It's okay.

12:24.083 --> 12:25.167
All right.

12:25.626 --> 12:28.837
There's another
reason I came to see you.

12:29.588 --> 12:32.048
It's in this picture.

12:35.261 --> 12:37.346
Something evil is
lurking in this town.

12:38.055 --> 12:40.682
A catastrophic danger is
fast approaching

12:42.268 --> 12:44.395
When the old man uses his
psychic photography

12:44.478 --> 12:45.687
to get a picture of you,

12:45.813 --> 12:47.022
this is the result.

12:47.481 --> 12:48.982
We don't know why…

12:49.191 --> 12:51.860
But he's likely a Stand user.

12:52.278 --> 12:54.071
This is all new to you, I know,

12:54.154 --> 12:55.697
but I wanted
to show you the picture.

12:56.115 --> 12:57.366
Be careful.

12:58.409 --> 12:59.618
Koichi…

12:59.868 --> 13:02.871
If you catch sight of him,
stay far away.

13:03.122 --> 13:04.623
Involving the police won't help.

13:04.748 --> 13:05.957
You have to run.

13:06.500 --> 13:07.250
Josuke…

13:07.793 --> 13:10.504
Keep your cool
and stay out of it.

13:11.297 --> 13:13.048
Or, like a moment ago,
you'll be sorry you did.

13:13.924 --> 13:15.383
Agh! High school orientation!

13:16.468 --> 13:18.386
Ack! It's already time!

13:18.679 --> 13:19.888
Shit…

13:20.264 --> 13:23.558
My mom's gonna kill me
if I show up late the first day!

13:23.851 --> 13:28.063
Hey, I'll listen to everything
you've got to say after school.

13:28.480 --> 13:30.482
Hey, Koichi, right? Let's go!

13:30.649 --> 13:31.149
Huh?

13:31.233 --> 13:31.816
Come on!

13:31.900 --> 13:32.650
Okay!

13:33.652 --> 13:38.152
<i>This is Josuke Higashikata,
the other weird friend I made.</i>

13:39.158 --> 13:41.118
<i>One moment he's shy
and unassuming,</i>

13:41.201 --> 13:42.619
<i>the next he's gone
completely mental.</i>

13:42.995 --> 13:44.955
<i>His family situation is complicated</i>

13:46.123 --> 13:48.625
<i>And we only just met…</i>

13:49.501 --> 13:50.793
<i>Josuke Higashikata…</i>

13:51.128 --> 13:52.587
<i>He's anything but normal.</i>

13:52.713 --> 13:54.715
<i>And his Stand..</i>

13:55.591 --> 13:58.802
<i>This hat…
It's back together but…</i>

13:58.927 --> 14:01.888
<i>His Stand destroys objects
then rearranges their structure.</i>

14:02.598 --> 14:05.475
<i>If he'd gotten
my face or my skull…</i>

14:06.435 --> 14:07.853
<i>Talk about gruesome.</i>

14:08.437 --> 14:12.937
<i>But as an ally, he could make
a more than capable fighter.</i>

14:13.817 --> 14:16.444
<i>Excluding that bizarre personality
of his, anyway</i>

14:17.571 --> 14:22.071
<i>I hope this doesn't involve Josuke.</i>

14:27.623 --> 14:29.416
JOSUKE HIGASHIKATA
SHINING DIAMOND

14:30.918 --> 14:32.419
Hey, good lookin'!

14:32.753 --> 14:35.547
Where ya headed?
Let me give you a ride.

14:35.881 --> 14:38.550
Hey, no need to be shy!

14:38.759 --> 14:40.469
C'mon! C'mon!

14:41.762 --> 14:44.639
Ooh, v-very pretty!

14:44.932 --> 14:46.892
So you'll go wherever I want?

14:47.101 --> 14:50.104
You bet!
I'll go anywhere you want me to!

14:50.562 --> 14:53.481
Then how bout a one-way trip to hell!

14:53.732 --> 14:54.482
Huh?

15:00.322 --> 15:02.282
Hey, son, you all right?

15:03.325 --> 15:04.451
Officer!

15:04.952 --> 15:06.995
Go catch that crazy bitch!

15:07.121 --> 15:08.664
That's assault! Assault!

15:09.123 --> 15:11.291
Nope, no can do.

15:11.625 --> 15:13.001
What?!

15:13.085 --> 15:14.961
Well, she's my daughter.

15:15.129 --> 15:15.712
Huh?

15:15.796 --> 15:19.674
Well, let's see.
You caused a public nuisance,

15:19.967 --> 15:22.719
and referred to my daughter
as a crazy bitch.

15:22.803 --> 15:24.262
I'll let you go this time.

15:24.596 --> 15:26.180
Let's be a bit more
careful next time, shall we?

15:30.602 --> 15:33.062
Madame Murakami,
are you all right?

15:33.480 --> 15:35.356
Here, I'll carry your bag.

15:39.361 --> 15:41.196
Hey, Tomoko!

15:41.447 --> 15:42.531
Dad.

15:42.990 --> 15:43.949
Heading home?

15:44.199 --> 15:44.949
Yep.

15:45.159 --> 15:48.620
I'll keep you company.
I'm done for the day.

15:49.163 --> 15:50.747
How's Josuke?

15:51.123 --> 15:52.457
Today was orientation, right?

15:52.666 --> 15:54.668
He'd better not be
up to any trouble.

15:55.252 --> 15:57.295
Hmph. Who knows?

15:57.379 --> 16:00.882
That moron may look innocent,
but he can lose it at the drop of a hat.

16:01.216 --> 16:02.550
I wonder
where he gets that from.

16:02.885 --> 16:04.052
Hey, easy there…

16:05.179 --> 16:05.929
But…

16:06.513 --> 16:09.474
Deep down,
he's a genuine, good kid.

16:10.309 --> 16:11.852
I'm not worried.

16:12.019 --> 16:12.936
That's the spirit.

16:13.061 --> 16:15.897
Now tonight we can celebrate.

16:16.064 --> 16:18.191
That was my plan.

16:18.484 --> 16:20.611
I doubt he'll come
straight home, though.

16:20.944 --> 16:22.445
He likes his detours.

16:22.613 --> 16:23.614
That he does.

16:24.114 --> 16:26.533
Hey, I wanna stop by Kameyu.

16:26.867 --> 16:30.161
Huh? I just bought you an
expensive bag!

16:30.245 --> 16:32.622
I want to look at clothes today!

16:33.874 --> 16:35.083
Watch it, dumb-ass!

16:36.376 --> 16:38.669
Watch where
you're walking, moron.

16:38.879 --> 16:40.881
That guy weirds me out.

16:40.964 --> 16:43.925
He slams into someone
and can't so much as apologize?

16:44.259 --> 16:46.594
Forget it. Let's go.

16:46.887 --> 16:49.347
I know. You just wanna go to
Kameyu, right?

16:50.933 --> 16:51.683
Huh?

16:57.564 --> 17:00.775
Anjuro Katagiri, a.k.a. Angelo.

17:01.109 --> 17:04.403
Born in Morioh, 1964.

17:04.780 --> 17:06.531
IQ: 160.

17:06.740 --> 17:08.241
He was sent to juvie
for robbery and rape

17:08.325 --> 17:10.618
when he was just twelve years old.

17:11.620 --> 17:13.913
That was just the beginning.

17:15.749 --> 17:17.959
He became known as
the most violent,

17:18.585 --> 17:21.462
shocking criminal to have
ever walked Japanese soil.

17:22.548 --> 17:26.051
He spent most of his youth in jail,

17:26.677 --> 17:29.221
twenty years by the time
he'd turned thirty-four.

17:29.596 --> 17:33.933
His final crime was so sinister,
it'd make a sewer rat puke.

17:34.643 --> 17:37.479
He was eventually arrested,
and was sentenced to…

17:37.563 --> 17:38.522
death.

17:40.274 --> 17:43.610
But the execution didn't kill him.

17:45.028 --> 17:47.530
Angelo escaped shortly after.

17:47.739 --> 17:51.576
He likely became a Stand
user right before his execution.

17:51.785 --> 17:53.286
I have no idea why,

17:54.079 --> 17:57.373
but he's hiding in the shadows
of this quiet town…

17:58.458 --> 17:59.459
somewhere.

18:03.630 --> 18:05.506
Oh, Koichi, heading home?

18:06.008 --> 18:07.718
Oh… Yeah.

18:08.010 --> 18:09.344
So we're in the same class.

18:09.511 --> 18:11.179
Yeah… What a coincidence.

18:11.513 --> 18:13.389
Well, see ya tomorrow.

18:13.557 --> 18:16.184
Um… Hey! J-Josuke!

18:17.728 --> 18:18.478
Huh?

18:20.230 --> 18:23.691
So you want to hear what
that Jotaro guy has to say?

18:24.151 --> 18:27.070
I can't stop thinking about it.
It's all happening in our own backyard.

18:27.321 --> 18:29.614
That's admirable.
But I think I'll pass.

18:30.073 --> 18:30.823
Why?

18:31.908 --> 18:35.036
I was sorta curious,
but after thinking it through,

18:35.329 --> 18:37.331
I figured it'd be best to

18:37.456 --> 18:39.875
keep clear of this
whole lovechild fiasco.

18:40.459 --> 18:41.209
Why?

18:41.877 --> 18:43.461
Well, I mean…

18:43.545 --> 18:46.130
Things are just fine
the way they are now.

18:46.590 --> 18:47.340
I see…

18:51.845 --> 18:52.554
What's that?

18:52.638 --> 18:54.264
Some kind of accident?

18:55.891 --> 18:56.766
Wanna check it out?

18:57.184 --> 18:57.934
Sure.

19:06.485 --> 19:07.903
What? Are they filming a drama?

19:08.111 --> 19:10.822
It's unsafe, get back.
Get back!

19:11.114 --> 19:12.740
What a commotion!

19:12.991 --> 19:14.909
A man robbing that
convenience store

19:14.993 --> 19:17.787
has taken the female employee
hostage inside.

19:18.372 --> 19:19.122
Huh?

19:19.289 --> 19:20.581
Look! He's coming out!

19:24.419 --> 19:26.295
Freeze!
Put down the knife!

19:27.839 --> 19:30.424
– Let the girl go!
– Shut up! Move back!

19:30.634 --> 19:33.803
Th-That lady has
rung me up before!

19:33.887 --> 19:37.724
I can see it in his eyes.
If he loses it, he'll kill her for sure.

19:38.058 --> 19:41.227
All you fools, outta the way!
I'm getting into the car!

19:41.478 --> 19:44.439
This isn't good, Josuke!
Get back! Back!

19:44.815 --> 19:47.526
– R-Right, sorry. Let us step back.
– You, with the dumb-ass hair!

19:48.568 --> 19:50.361
I told you to get away from the car!

19:50.570 --> 19:51.821
I'll kill you!

19:52.072 --> 19:53.406
I have…

19:53.699 --> 19:55.450
a bad feeling about this.

19:57.786 --> 19:59.829
<i>I knew it!</i>

20:01.581 --> 20:03.833
<i>Oh no! Here it comes!</i>

20:04.167 --> 20:06.294
Right now? Right here?

20:06.461 --> 20:09.088
And Mr. Jotaro warned him!

20:09.297 --> 20:10.131
Who's that?

20:10.257 --> 20:11.675
H-Hey! Stop!

20:14.219 --> 20:16.596
The hell you just say?

20:16.763 --> 20:19.182
Wh-Who the hell are you?
Get the hell away from me!

20:19.266 --> 20:20.809
I'll gut her right here, I swear!

20:21.101 --> 20:21.935
Move away, you fool!

20:22.018 --> 20:23.811
If he snaps, you're done for!

20:23.979 --> 20:26.106
You bastards stay back, too!

20:26.189 --> 20:29.692
God dammit!
That's fucking it!

20:29.943 --> 20:33.571
I'm gonna do it!
I'm gonna slaughter this bitch!

20:36.116 --> 20:37.325
Is that so?

20:44.207 --> 20:46.334
H-He's got a hole in his body!

20:48.503 --> 20:50.171
Did I piss you off?

20:50.672 --> 20:52.590
You should know,
that's my line!

20:55.552 --> 20:57.929
Huh? I-I'm totally fine!

20:58.472 --> 21:00.348
She's back to normal.
It's happening again!

21:02.684 --> 21:05.978
M-My knife! It's inside my body!

21:06.188 --> 21:07.939
H-How the…?!

21:08.023 --> 21:11.818
You'd better get a surgeon to take
that out… in the prison hospital.

21:13.445 --> 21:14.612
S-Seize him!

21:14.780 --> 21:16.281
What's going on?

21:16.490 --> 21:17.282
Josuke!

21:17.532 --> 21:18.783
Hey, Koichi.

21:18.992 --> 21:21.244
Are you okay?!
That was…

21:23.246 --> 21:24.038
What the…

21:24.122 --> 21:26.415
What the hell's happening?

21:27.667 --> 21:28.959
Well, what a surprise!

21:29.294 --> 21:32.046
We have another Stand user!

21:32.380 --> 21:36.550
And I was having so much fun
using that louse for my armed robbery…

21:36.927 --> 21:39.387
Then you had to get in my way!

21:39.721 --> 21:41.347
He's the guy from the picture!

21:45.060 --> 21:48.063
I'll be keeping an eye on you.

21:48.814 --> 21:52.400
Wherever you are.
Whatever you do.

21:52.984 --> 21:54.735
What'd you say, dirt bag?!

21:57.823 --> 21:58.698
Josuke!

21:59.699 --> 22:01.283
You idiot! Get him!

22:01.618 --> 22:03.411
– The hell was all that?!
– W-Wait a sec…

22:09.042 --> 22:11.461
<i>Mr. Jotaro was telling the truth.</i>

22:17.050 --> 22:18.926
<i>Something is in this town…
I can feel it.</i>

22:19.010 --> 22:21.929
<i>Something bizarre.</i>

22:23.223 --> 22:25.850
<i>Something here in Morioh…</i>

22:26.351 --> 22:27.894
<i>Something terrible!</i>

22:33.733 --> 22:35.860
Hey, Josuke! Get the phone!

22:36.903 --> 22:39.155
Josuke!
Answer the damn phone!

22:39.281 --> 22:41.866
Yeah, yeah. I'm getting it…

22:43.994 --> 22:45.161
Hello…

22:45.245 --> 22:45.995
<i>It's Jotaro.</i>

22:46.329 --> 22:47.204
Oh, hi.

22:47.706 --> 22:49.916
<i>Our conversation yesterday
was too brief</i>

22:50.417 --> 22:53.002
<i>We need to talk about
the guy hiding in this town.</i>

22:53.086 --> 22:55.463
Um, well, I wanted to
talk about that.

22:55.630 --> 22:58.007
Mr. Jotaro, where are you?

22:58.592 --> 23:00.176
The Morioh Grand Hotel.

23:00.844 --> 23:01.678
What's up?

23:02.262 --> 23:03.638
<i>Since you mention it…</i>

23:04.598 --> 23:06.808
Dammit, freak in pisses me off.

23:07.100 --> 23:09.143
Where the hell did I put the shovel?

23:10.353 --> 23:12.229
Little brat…

23:12.397 --> 23:15.525
He's got the perfect little family.

23:16.151 --> 23:19.821
Not to mention
a hot, young mom…

23:20.447 --> 23:23.283
Lucky bastard…

23:23.491 --> 23:27.870
Josuke Higashikata,
better not get too cocky.

23:28.788 --> 23:31.832
Cause I'm gonna
stomp on your soul

23:31.917 --> 23:33.919
and your precious
little life.

23:39.299 --> 23:42.010
EPISODE 2
JOSUKE HIGASHIKATA! MEETS ANGELO
